            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ganita Prakash | Grade 7 | Part-II"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.087,
            0.846,
            0.127
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Identify which of the following statements can be justified using this data."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.137,
            0.83,
            0.158
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) All organisations launched more rockets than the previous years."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.162,
            0.846,
            0.201
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) Only an organisation from the USA launched more than 50 rockets in a single year."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.206,
            0.846,
            0.244
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) The total number of rockets launched by France in all 3 years is less than 40."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.25,
            0.846,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) The average number of rockets launched by CASC in these 3 years is around 40."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.294,
            0.839,
            0.315
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(e) ISRO launched more rockets than Galactic Energy in these 3 years."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.319,
            0.729,
            0.339
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(f) Russia launched more than 60 rockets in these 3 years."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.348,
            0.846,
            0.389
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? List the organisations that have consistently launched more rockets every year."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.403,
            0.793,
            0.467
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Estimate the total number of rockets launched worldwide in 2023. (a) less than 200 (b) 200 to 400 (c) 400 to 600 (d) more than 600"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.478,
            0.846,
            0.557
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We may have many questions after looking at the graph. We might wonder why USA launches so many more rockets than other countries. Or we might be eager to look at the data from previous and later years. What are you curious to know after looking at this graph?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.574,
            0.615,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Summer and Winter at the Same Time"
